            "value" : "缩小下方结果。磁盘图和你的移除选择保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Narrow this list of files of 1 MB or more. The disk map and your removal choices stay the same." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
